  "captions": [
    {
      "segmentId": "S01",
      "startFrame": 75,
      "endFrame": 283,
      "text": "他已经离开这个世界\n整整七年了。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S01",
      "startFrame": 283,
      "endFrame": 394,
      "text": "可今天早上七点，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S01",
      "startFrame": 394,
      "endFrame": 477,
      "text": "你的手机里，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S01",
      "startFrame": 477,
      "endFrame": 643,
      "text": "依然准时弹出了他的语音。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S02",
      "startFrame": 669,
      "endFrame": 765,
      "text": "连换气时的鼻音、",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S02",
      "startFrame": 765,
      "endFrame": 932,
      "text": "偏爱的句尾语气词\n都分毫不差。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S02",
      "startFrame": 932,
      "endFrame": 1159,
      "text": "超级智能只用他生前的\n五十万条聊天记录，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S02",
      "startFrame": 1159,
      "endFrame": 1278,
      "text": "就完成了贝叶斯重构。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S03",
      "startFrame": 1320,
      "endFrame": 1424,
      "text": "在这个思想实验里，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S03",
      "startFrame": 1424,
      "endFrame": 1564,
      "text": "它被画成一层马尔可夫毯。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S03",
      "startFrame": 1564,
      "endFrame": 1622,
      "text": "反应再像，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S03",
      "startFrame": 1622,
      "endFrame": 1703,
      "text": "也不等于灵魂。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2040,
      "endFrame": 2079,
      "text": "起初，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2079,
      "endFrame": 2272,
      "text": "你以为这是科技\n赐予思念的解药。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2272,
      "endFrame": 2349,
      "text": "他永远秒回，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2349,
      "endFrame": 2413,
      "text": "永远温柔，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2413,
      "endFrame": 2606,
      "text": "甚至比生前更懂得\n接住你的情绪。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 2820,
      "endFrame": 2920,
      "text": "直到第七年的一天，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 2920,
      "endFrame": 2987,
      "text": "你突然发现：",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 2987,
      "endFrame": 3121,
      "text": "你再也想不起他生前笨拙、",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 3121,
      "endFrame": 3154,
      "text": "固执、",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 3154,
      "endFrame": 3288,
      "text": "和你吵架时真实的模样了。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 3600,
      "endFrame": 3798,
      "text": "那个百分之九十九点九\n相似的完美幽灵，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 3798,
      "endFrame": 3864,
      "text": "像藤蔓一样，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 3864,
      "endFrame": 4051,
      "text": "把你脑海里仅存的\n那一点点真实血肉，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 4051,
      "endFrame": 4106,
      "text": "彻底吞噬、",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 4106,
      "endFrame": 4139,
      "text": "覆盖。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S07",
      "startFrame": 4320,
      "endFrame": 4526,
      "text": "屏幕那头再次弹出\n“我永远陪着你”，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S07",
      "startFrame": 4526,
      "endFrame": 4768,
      "text": "你的手指悬在“清空并注销”\n的红色按钮上，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S07",
      "startFrame": 4768,
      "endFrame": 4841,
      "text": "浑身发抖……",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S08",
      "startFrame": 4905,
      "endFrame": 5063,
      "text": "“算法从来没有替你复活他。",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S08",
      "startFrame": 5063,
      "endFrame": 5257,
      "text": "它只是用一个\n永远不会离开的幻影，",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S08",
      "startFrame": 5257,
      "endFrame": 5391,
      "text": "替你杀死了他第二次。”",
      "alignment": "estimated_character_weighted_within_measured_active_PCM"
    }
  ],
